OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after A66 crash
OL,4,Adenies drug dealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested in the wake of the A66
OL,7,Fcrash which killed seven people,
OL,8,Fincluding two police officers, has
OL,9,Fdenied dealing cocaine.
OL,11,FCameron George, 26, pleaded not guilty
OL,12,Fto possessing Class A drugs with intent
OL,13,Fto supply and having criminal property,
OL,14,Fnamely money, when he appeared at
OL,15,FTeesside Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
