OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after A66 crash
OL,4,Adenies drug dealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was arrested on 22 August as part of
OL,7,Fpolice action hours after the crash
OL,8,Fnear Middlesbrough, which killed PC Tom
OL,9,FClough and PC Matthew Blades in their
OL,10,Fresponse car and five other men, who
OL,11,Fwere in a VW Passat going the wrong way
OL,12,Fdown the dual carriageway.
OL,14,FGeorge, of Micklow Close, Redcar, was
OL,15,Fremanded into custody with a trial set
OL,16,Ffor 4 February.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
